//
// Mohio Language Pack — tlhIngan Hol (Klingon)
// maps/en-klingon.langmap
//
// Community pack — demonstration only
// "nuqDaq 'oH puchpa''e'" (Where is the bathroom?)
// is not in here. But fraud detection is. Priorities.
//
// Connectors (on. do. as. is. not. if. with. from. to. in.)
// are NEVER translated — they are Mohio structure, not vocabulary.
//
// Format: english token -> klingon token
// -> means one direction (English source → Klingon display)
// <-> means bidirectional (either can be the source)
//

// Core sector and compliance
sector          <-> yoS
financial       <-> Huch
healthcare      <-> Qel
connect         <-> muv
include         <-> contained

// Listening and routing
listen for      <-> Qoy
new             <-> chu'
// at -- protected connector, not translated (route path marker)

// Access control
require role    <-> poQ ghoj
or              <-> pagh

// Data operations
find            <-> Sam
where           <-> 'e'
up to           <-> mI'
order by        <-> rI'
descending      <-> bIngDaq
match           <-> nob
above           <-> law'
below           <-> puS
after           <-> 'el
save to         <-> polHa'
update          <-> choH
give back       <-> nobHa'

// Conditions
check           <-> ngu'
when            <-> e'
otherwise       <-> qaSbe'chugh
unless          <-> 'ach

// AI primitives — note: ai. prefix never changes. Only the word after it.
// ai.decide, ai.audit, ai.explain, ai.connect — these stay as-is
// The WORDS inside the block translate
confidence above    <-> Daj law'
confidence below    <-> Daj puS
weigh               <-> ngI'
not confident       <-> Daj puS qaSbe'
fallback            <-> lujDI'

// Notifications and logging
notify              <-> ja'
via                 <-> lo'
message             <-> mu'mey

// Status values
pending             <-> loS
approved            <-> chaw'
blocked             <-> botlh

// Shapes and types
shape               <-> meQ
as text             <-> mu'mey rur
as decimal          <-> mI' rur
as boolean          <-> ghap
as datetime         <-> poH
required            <-> poQ
optional            <-> wIv
default             <-> motlh

// Variables and holds
hold                <-> pol
lock                <-> jon

// Give back with status
"Transaction approved"   <-> "Duj chaw'lu'"
"Transaction blocked"    <-> "Duj botlhlu'"
"Referred to manual review" <-> "loSwI' legh vIneH"
"Fraud check unavailable"   <-> "quvHa' ngu' chavbe'"

// Expanded set — for a second demonstration program
show            <-> 'ang
hide            <-> So'
page            <-> HaSta
each            <-> Hoch
send            <-> ngeH
count           <-> togh
first           <-> wa'DIch
last            <-> Qav
repeat          <-> qaSqa'
true            <-> HIja'
false           <-> ghobe'
